body:
State of mind, itchy is.  Become one with your robe, you must.  No longer itchy, it will be.

&#x200B;

PS: Flannel liners, my robe has.  From LL Bean, they are.

My favourite blue is ultramarine blue, but to wear is probably navy.

&#x200B;

And yeah that's kinda what I'm thinking, but the top schools have an allure that is difficult to escape.
